{
    desc => q{i enters insert mode and typing inserts text before cursor},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
## Macro: `xt/visual/macros/insert_typing`

Tests basic insert mode: **i** enters insert mode before the cursor,
typed text is inserted, and **Escape** returns to normal mode.

**Keys:** `i`, type `Hello `, `Escape`

**initial.png**
- Buffer contains "world"
- Cursor at column 0 on 'w'

**after_typing.png**
- Line reads "Hello world" ("Hello " inserted before 'w')
- Cursor on 'w' (moved back one after Escape)
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->key('i');
        $ctx->type('Hello ');
        $ctx->key('Escape');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_typing');
    },
}
__DATA__
world
